<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
  <Fixlet>
    <Title>Warning - System ignores driver&apos;s digital signature state - Windows</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[<P>If this fixlet is relevant then the system is configured to ignore (not prompt on installation) when an attempt is made to install a driver that does not have a digital signature.</P>
<P>This is&nbsp;a potentially dangerous non-default configuration.&nbsp;</P>
<P>For general information or to report issues with C3 Inventory content please visit GitHub here: <A href="https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Inventory">https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Inventory</A></P>]]></Description>
    <Relevance>NOT in proxy agent context</Relevance>
    <Relevance><![CDATA[windows of operating system and version of operating system >= "5.1"]]></Relevance>
    <Relevance>(value &quot;Policy&quot; of key &quot;HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\Software\Microsoft\Non-Driver Signing&quot; of native registry as string) = &quot;00&quot;</Relevance>
    <Source>Internal</Source>
    <SourceReleaseDate>2016-04-23</SourceReleaseDate>
    <MIMEField>
    	<Name>x-fixlet-modification-time</Name>
    	<Value>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 21:19:03 +0000</Value>
    </MIMEField>
    <Domain>BESC</Domain>
  </Fixlet>
</BES>
